reg_decoder_fld_t tof2_dprsr_he_regs__dprsr_he_regs_h__h__cfg48_mask_fld_list[] = {
    { "cfg", 30, 0, 0,0, 
      "Specify the cfg_mask used to match against the live data.  Counter ctr will increment when the expression   ( live_data & cfg_mask[ctr] ) == cfg_data[ctr] evaluates to true. Live data is logic evaluated by the ingress and egress Header Arbiter Block.    [30:23] 1=new pkt received from channels on MAC2 [22:15] 1=new pkt received from channels on MAC1 [14:13] 1=new pkt received from channels on MAC0 [12]  1=new pkt received from MAC2 (any channel) [11]  1=new pkt received from MAC1 (any channel) [10]  1=new pkt received from MAC0 (either channel)     [9]   ctrl_cell_num_one_or_more, (at least one header cell created) [8]   ctrl_cell_eoh, 1 = last hdr cell created [7:6] ctrl_cmd, (0=none 1=process 2= process+discard 3=discard) [5:4] ctrl_mac_id, (0,1 or 2) [3:1] ctrl_chan_id, (0-1 for MAC0, 0-7 for MACs 1 and 2) [0]   ctrl_vld (1 = bits [9:1] are valid)" },
};
